nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

assertion  XBD.poll.h.008
anchor     basedefs/poll.h.html#DESCRIPTION/timespec
class      required
since      2024
says       <poll.h> defines struct timespec as a complete type.
test       t/008-complete-timespec.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

